This Terraform program creates an AWS Lightsail instance with a PostgreSQL database and an EBS snapshot that is created on deletion. The EBS snapshot is created from the EBS volume associated with the Lightsail instance. The `aws_ebs_snapshot` resource is used instead of `aws_rds_snapshot` because the AWS provider schema does not support `aws_rds_snapshot`. The `volume_id` attribute of the `aws_ebs_snapshot` resource is set to the first EBS volume ID associated with the Lightsail instance. The `tags` attribute of the `aws_ebs_snapshot` resource is set to include the same tags as the Lightsail instance. The `output` block is used to output the ARN of the EBS snapshot.

